===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*dʰwer-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|dore}}, {{m|enm|dor}}, from {{inh|en|ang|duru||door}}, {{m|ang|dor||gate}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*dur}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*durz}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*dʰwṓr}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*dʰwer-||doorway, door, gate}}. {{doublet|en|fuero|forum}}.

